          "content": {
            "id": "ffe33316-fa8a-349c-9104-1f2569241531",
            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "Warren Buffett issues warning about AI videos of him",
            "description": "<p>Warren Buffett is warning people about artificial intelligence (AI)-generated videos of him. <a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://www.businesswire.com/news/home/20251106755718/en/Berkshire-Hathaway-Inc.\">A release</a> from Berkshire Hathaway (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/BRK-B\">BRK-B</a>, <a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/BRK-A\">BRK-A</a>) titled \"It\u2019s Not Me\" states, \"Mr. Buffett is concerned that these types of fraudulent videos are becoming a spreading virus. Individuals who are less familiar with Mr. Buffett may believe these videos are real and be misled by the contents of these videos.\" The statement goes on to add that on Monday, Nov. 10, the company will issue a press release on Buffett's \"philanthropy, Berkshire and other matters that Berkshire shareholders and others may find to be of interest.\"</p>\n<p><em>Editor's note: The video above contains an excerpt from an AI-generated clip Berkshire Hathaway highlighted in its release.</em></p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more <a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-domination/\">Market Domination</a>.</p>",
            "summary": "Warren Buffett is warning people about artificial intelligence (AI)-generated videos of him. A release from Berkshire Hathaway (BRK-B, BRK-A) titled \"It\u2019s Not Me\" states, \"Mr. Buffett is concerned that these types of fraudulent videos are becoming a spreading virus. Individuals who are less familiar with Mr. Buffett may believe these videos are real and be misled by the contents of these videos.\" The statement goes on to add that on Monday, Nov. 10, the company will issue a press release on Buffett's \"philanthropy, Berkshire and other matters that Berkshire shareholders and others may find to be of interest.\" Editor's note: The video above contains an excerpt from an AI-generated clip Berkshire Hathaway highlighted in its release. To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more Market Domination.",
